 "words": 252,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Gideon was hiding, threshing wheat where none could see",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Scared of all the Midianites, like locusts on the trees",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Then an angel sat beneath the oak and said to him",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The LORD is with you, mighty warrior",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Who, me? said Gideon, I am the least of all",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.43,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But God said, I will be with you, and God is never small",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.41,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Blow your trumpet, toot toot toot",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Smash your jar, crash crash crash",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Hold your torch up shining bright",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A sword for the LORD and for Gideon",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "God can win with just a few",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "When we trust him, me and you",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Gideon was nervous, so he laid a woolly fleece",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "On the threshing floor at night and said, God, show me please",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.5,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In the morning, wet fleece, and the ground was dry all round",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Next night, dry fleece, and dew on all the ground",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Thirty-two thousand soldiers came to stand at Gideon's side",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Too many, said the LORD, or they will boast in pride",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Down to ten thousand, then down to the stream they went",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Three hundred lapped the water, and those were the ones God sent",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.41,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Blow your trumpet, toot toot toot",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Smash your jar, crash crash crash",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
