   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "God can win with just a few",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "When we trust him, me and you",
